animation_notes: |
  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 06: Golden Test Pyramid & Security Layers

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: The Golden Pyramid" (0:06–0:22)**
  Camera: FPV drone dives through volumetric fog into a three-tier glassmorphism pyramid
  floating in the vacuum. Each tier is frosted glass with distinct internal neon filaments:
  - Base (Standard Tests): wide slab, gray (#95A5A6) neon filaments — Deep Cobalt glass.
    The widest tier, reflecting the largest test count.
  - Middle (Promoted Tests): narrower slab, amber (#ffa500) neon filaments.
  - Apex (Golden Tests): smallest slab, GOLD (#FFD700) neon filaments casting a warm
    aureate glow. Ray-traced gold reflections shimmer on the surrounding fog.
  A bioluminescent test orb starts at the base. Five radial quality gate indicators
  materialize around the pyramid — Determinism, Coverage, Independence, Speed, Diagnostic
  Value — each a frosted glass gauge with cyan filaments. As the orb passes each gate,
  the gauge pulses. Score exceeds threshold: the orb floats UPWARD to the Golden tier
  with a gold shimmer trail, accompanied by a crystalline chime.
  Flaky test scenario: a golden orb at the apex flickers red → destabilizes → drops
  DOWN to Standard tier (glass dims from gold to gray, trail fades to ash).

  **SCENE 3 — "The Five Security Rings" (0:22–0:38)**
  Camera: Pans right to reveal five concentric glassmorphism rings — each a frosted
  Deep Cobalt (#1a1f3a) torus floating in the vacuum with distinct neon filaments:
  - Ring 1 (Pre-Commit): red (#ff4444) filaments — innermost, tightest.
    "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scans the ring surface.
  - Ring 2 (Governance Rules): amber (#ffa500) filaments.
  - Ring 3 (LENS Security Scan): cyan (#00d4ff) filaments — a LENS beam sweeps clockwise.
    Vulnerability badges materialize on the ring surface — P0 (red), P1 (amber), P2 (blue).
  - Ring 4 (Vulnerability Orchestration): purple (#7b61ff) filaments.
  - Ring 5 (Release Gate): green (#00ff88) filaments — outermost, final barrier.
  A bioluminescent code particle enters from the center, must pass through each ring.
  Ring 1: Secret detected — red flash, particle bounces back with a shockwave.
  Particle reforms with fix, passes through each ring (iris opening animation).
  Ring 5: Final gate — aggregated score badge materializes. Green pass: particle
  exits with a green corona. Red block: particle shatters (failure scenario ghost).

  **SCENE 4 — "Unified Architecture" (0:38–0:48)**
  Camera: Wide pull-back. Pyramid (left) and Security Rings (right) are now both
  visible. A glassmorphism bridge materializes between them — the Governance Engine
  (purple #7b61ff neon filaments) connecting both structures. SQLite Audit Trail
  renders as a glass cylinder below, receiving data streams from both structures.
  The SDLC Timeline renders as a horizontal glassmorphism bar at the bottom:
  Coding → Commit → Analysis → Planning → Deploy — each phase connected to its
  corresponding security ring via a pulsing neon conduit.

  **SCENE 5 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:48–0:58)**
  Camera: 360-degree orbital pan around the combined Pyramid + Security Rings + Bridge.
  Golden tests glow with their aureate luminosity. Security rings pulse in sequence.
  Volumetric fog swirls beneath all structures. Ray-traced reflections cascade across
  every glass surface. Camera completes orbit, pulls back. Architecture fades to 40%.
  Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes center-frame — sealed document
  with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
